data: {"id": "b5c581df2f934d0f-thinking-parallel_evidence-1682", "run_id": "b5c581df2f934d0f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "证据结论：\n\n- **事实**：\n  - Pod `workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` 在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间，调度到 `node2`，Phase=Pending，状态=ContainerCreating，81 分钟未变，无 IP。\n  - Prometheus 指标：`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 的 reason 为 `ContainerCreating`，无重启。\n  - Events 明确：`NoNetworkFound` 与 `FailedCreatePodSandBox`，原文指出缺失 NetworkAttachmentDefinition `unavailable-network`（`network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io` not found），由 Multus CNI 插件触发；事件已持续约 79 分钟，重复 357 次。\n  - Pod YAML：使用镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observabi", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788783048179, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

