data: {"id": "b5c581df2f934d0f-final", "run_id": "b5c581df2f934d0f", "seq": 1687, "ts_ms": 1788783067032, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx (aiops-case-05) stuck in ContainerCreating phase due to FailedCreatePodSandBox |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning FailedCreatePodSandBox` kubelet: `failed to setup network for sandbox... plugin type=\"multus\" name=\"multus-cni-network\" failed (add)... cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)` (fact_id: `fact-3089ff791257`) | 直接证明 Pod 调度失败机制，Multus 插件因无法获取网络配置而拒绝创建容器 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning NoNetworkFound` multus: `cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found` (fact_id: `fact-0679dd705195`) | 提供根本原因证据，确认 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间下缺失名为 `unavailable-network` 的 CRD 资源 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `ContainerCreating` (fact_id: `fact-89854a08737e`) | 确认 Pod 当前异常状态，符合因网络初始化失败导致的阻塞表现 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1, labels: `reason=\"ContainerCreating\"`, `container=\"app\"` (fact_id: `fact-c3800a4a31e3`) | 监控侧数据独立印证 Pod 处于等待状态 |\n\n**证据关系：**\nKubernetes 事件明确指出了失败链路：因缺少 `unavailable-network` 这一具体的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 资源（事实 2），导致 Multus CNI 插件无法完成网络配置（事实 1），最终致使 Pod 停留在 `ContainerCreating` 状态（事实 3）。Metric 数据（事实 4）作为客观的持续观测，独立证实了该阻塞状态的存在。Logging 和 Tracing 因容器未启动而不可用，但不影响基于 K8s 状态机事件的诊断。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n命名空间 aiops-case-05 中缺失 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 'unavailable-network' → Multus CNI 插件无法获取网络配置 → 容器沙箱创建失败 (FailedCreatePodSandBox) → Pod 卡在 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **命名空间 `aiops-case-05` 中缺失名为 `unavailable-network` 的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 资源**。\n\n该缺失导致 Multus CNI 插件在执行网络插件时无法找到预期的网络配置定义，从而引发 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 错误，使 Pod 无法进入运行状态。该结论由 K8s 事件中的 `NoNetworkFound` 警告及具体的 `not found` 错误原文直接支撑（证据 1、2）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 22.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 50.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx: 50.6s (Evidence 42.2s, RCA 8.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx**: pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 83.357, "metrics": {"run_id": "b5c581df2f934d0f", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 83.36328268051147, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "53%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.9, "weighted_score": 0.18, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 90%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 83363.28268051147, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 69121.20246887207, "tool_calls": 11, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 11, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 37237.32304573059, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 13635.740041732788}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 22330.748319625854, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 50607.9421043396, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 10404.81686592102, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

